   "answer": "<code>forEach</code> ignores the return value of its callback, so the promises from the async callbacks are thrown away and the code after <code>forEach</code> runs at once. Use <code>for...of</code> with <code>await</code> to run one after another, or <code>await Promise.all(items.map(async item =&gt; ...))</code> to run them in parallel.",
