   "answer": "<code>sequential</code> takes about 200 ms because the second wait starts only after the first ends. <code>parallel</code> takes about 100 ms because both waits start before either is awaited.",
   "explain": "<p>Start independent work first and await later, or use <code>Promise.all</code>. In API test set up, creating ten users in parallel can be ten times faster than awaiting each one in turn, as long as the server can handle it.</p>",
